#: .\templates\home.html:218
msgid "Keep places. Keep memories."
msgstr "Keep places. Keep memories."

#: .\templates\home.html:221
msgid ""
" WhereNow 是一個用來記錄地點、建立回憶、整理收藏，\n"
"    並支援情侶共享生活紀錄的 Web 系統。 "
msgstr ""
"WhereNow is a web system for recording places, creating memories, organizing "
"favorites, and supporting shared life records for couples."

#: .\templates\home.html:227
msgid "開始探索"
msgstr "Start Exploring"

#: .\templates\home.html:231
msgid "查看個人資料"
msgstr "View Profile"

#: .\templates\home.html:236
msgid "探索公開內容"
msgstr "Explore Public Content"

#: .\templates\home.html:239
msgid ""
" 你可以依照關鍵字、分類、地區與預算，\n"
"      探索別人公開分享的地點與回憶。 "
msgstr ""
"You can explore public places and memories shared by others by keyword, "
"category, area, and budget."

#: .\templates\home.html:245
msgid "關鍵字"
msgstr "Keyword"

#: .\templates\home.html:252
msgid "例如：淡水、咖啡廳、約會、台北"
msgstr "Example: Tamsui, cafe, date, Taipei"

#: .\templates\home.html:257
msgid "分類"
msgstr "Category"

#: .\templates\home.html:260
msgid "不限"
msgstr "Any"

#: .\templates\home.html:269
msgid "地區"
msgstr "Area"

#: .\templates\home.html:276
msgid "例如：台北、淡水"
msgstr "Example: Taipei, Tamsui"

