msgid "搜尋"
msgstr "Search"

#: .\templates\home.html:307
msgid "清除"
msgstr "Clear"

#: .\templates\home.html:316
msgid "搜尋分類"
msgstr "Search category"

#: .\templates\explore.html:10
msgid "探索內容"
msgstr "Explore Content"

#: .\templates\explore.html:13
msgid "這裡會同時顯示公開內容、你的私人內容，以及伴侶與你共享的內容。"
msgstr ""
"This page shows public content, your private content, and content shared "
"with your partner."

#: .\templates\explore.html:22
msgid "地點名稱、心得、使用者"
msgstr "Place name, review, user"

#: .\templates\explore.html:40
msgid "例如：台中、淡水"
msgstr "Example: Taichung, Tamsui"

#: .\templates\explore.html:56
msgid "套用篩選"
msgstr "Apply Filter"

#: .\templates\explore.html:57
msgid "清除條件"
msgstr "Clear Filter"

#: .\templates\explore.html:72
msgid "沒有圖片"
msgstr "No Image"

#: .\templates\explore.html:92
msgid "查看內容"
msgstr "View Content"

#: .\templates\explore.html:101
msgid "沒有找到符合條件的內容"
msgstr "No matching content found"

#: .\templates\explore.html:103
msgid "你可以試著調整關鍵字、地區或預算條件再搜尋一次。"
msgstr ""
"Try adjusting the keyword, area, or budget and search again."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:12
msgid "共享回憶列表"
msgstr "Shared Memories"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"              查看你和 %(partner_name)s 彼此共享的回憶內容。\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"              View memories shared between you and %(partner_name)s.\n"
"            "

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:19
msgid "我的回憶列表"
msgstr "My Memories"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:21
msgid ""
"把每一次約會、旅行、日常片段與重要時刻收藏起來，讓回憶不只是被記住，而是能被重新打開與回看。"
msgstr ""
"Save every date, trip, daily moment, and important memory so they can "
"always be revisited."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:27
msgid "新增回憶"
msgstr "Add Memory"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:34
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
